:solution
$()On utilise les propriétés du logarithme : 
!insmath log($val7 \times $val8)=log($val7)+log($val8)
$();
!insmath log\left (\frac{1}{$val8} \right )=-log($val8)
$();	
!insmath log \left (\frac{$val7}{$val8} \right )=log($val7)-log($val8)
$(); 
!insmath log($val7^$val9)=$val9 \;log($val7)
$().
$()
